# F5 test: M84 clears the extruder homing state.
#
# After homing, M84 must clear the extruder homing state, so a later E
# move must raise "Must home extruder axis first" again.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG homeable_extruder.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

# Home XYZ and the homeable extruder.
G28

# Turning the motors off clears the homing state.
M84

# Extruding after M84 must fail.
G1 E5 F600
